r('A long-running Reno flow oscillates between W/2 and W, averaging about **0.75 W**.','A simplified stable sawtooth with linear growth from W/2 to W has time-average window **0.75 W**. Timeouts, unequal cycles, variable RTTs and application limits change that model.')
